<title>USA: TEXACO Calif plant at reduced rate - company.</title>
<headline>TEXACO Calif plant at reduced rate - company.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texaco Inc is operating its Wilmington oil refinery in the Los Angeles area at a reduced rate following a Monday fire in a hydrotreating unit that has been contained by firefighters, the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;The fire is contained and burning itself out,&quot; a company spokeswoman said, adding there were no injuries or serious air emissions from the blaze that began at 1030 EST this morning.</p>
<p>She said the refinery, with an operating capacity of almost 100,000 barrels per day, &quot;is not completely down. It is operating at a reduced rate.&quot;</p>
</text>
